<section class="settings__section">
  <header>
    <h2 class="divider">A good meeting</h2>
  </header>
  <ul class="record-steps txt-small">
    <li>The agenda goes out at least <%= (AccountManagement::Playbook::AGENDA_AHEAD / 1.hour).round %> hours ahead, with the research already done on what was left open.</li>
